WEBVTT

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.976
I see, I see one way in the back.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.976
You sir, that's three.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.824
And anybody on this side here?

00:00:35.848 --> 00:00:37.348
OK, over there on the aisle.

00:00:37.372 --> 00:00:40.006
Would the four of you
please bring out your calculators,

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.451
then join me up on stage.

00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:43.715
Let's give them a nice round of applause.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:46.552
(Applause)

00:00:46.576 --> 00:00:47.661
That's right.

00:00:47.685 --> 00:00:51.099
Now, since I haven't had the chance
to work with these calculators,

00:00:51.123 --> 00:00:53.976
I need to make sure
that they are all working properly.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.330
Would somebody get us started by giving us
a two-digit number, please?

00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:00.863
How about a two-digit number?